flowchart LR
  PASS[User secret or device key] --> KDF[Memory-hard KDF]
  KDF --> WK[Workspace key]
  WK --> DOC[Encrypt document operations]
  WK --> ATT[Encrypt attachment chunks]
  WK --> ENV[Device/member key envelopes]
  DOC --> SERVER[(Untrusted sync storage)]
  ATT --> SERVER
  ENV --> SERVER
  SERVER -. ciphertext only .-> CLIENT[Authorised client]
  CLIENT --> WK
